shabbir pa ye kaisi qayamat ki ghadi hai <br>
reti pa padi laash-e-jawa'n khoo'n me bhari hai<br>
<br>
zainab ki tamanna tha jo laila ka dil o jaa'n <br>
us noujawan ke seene me barchhi ki ani hai<br>
<br>
kyu'n haath hai seene pa ye shabbir ne puchha <br>
akber ne kaha barchhi ki takleef badi hai<br>
<br>
ye aakhri khwahish thi ke sughra ka ho deedar <br>
dekhe jo raah takti behen dar pa khadi hai<br>
<br>
akber se bohat milne ko behchain hai laila <br>
hojaye mulaqaat yahi sheh ki sayi hai<br>
<br>
bachchou se kaha lasha-e-akber ko uthao <br>
lillah shah-e-dee'n ki musibat ye badi hai<br>
<br>
kya haal hua hoga hussain ibne ali ka <br>
hichki ali akber ne junhi mout ki li hai<br>
<br>
ye kehke shah e waala ne thaama hai jigar ko <br>
maara gaya karbal me jo hamshakle nabi hai<br>
<br>
akber tere marne se dikhayi nahi deta <br>
abbas ke marne se kamar toot gayi hai<br>
<br>
barchhi se jigar chaak pidar bete ka dekhe <br>
kaisa ye fasih sabr-e-dil o jaan e ali hai<br>
